"""Approximate a multilingual 'in'/containment feature from surface clues.

Tokens spelling 'in' at a word boundary, and selected location-preposition
translations, get negative responses. Recent function words and characteristic
letters disambiguate languages. Affixes, Chinese 在 and set membership ∈ have
smaller responses. English case, document starts, 'result in' and traceback
lines receive simple corrections. Keep only 200 characters, reset per document.
